     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi everyone,<div><br></div><div><div>I&#39;ve just started using MSstats and I&#39;m pretty new to R in general. When using ProgenesistoMSstatsFormat() I get the following error:</div><div><br></div><div>Error in `colnames&lt;-`(`*tmp*`, value = c(&quot;ProteinName&quot;, &quot;PeptideSequence&quot;,  : </div><div>  &#39;names&#39; attribute [5] must be the same length as the vector [3]</div></div><div><br></div><div>I think this means that it&#39;s trying to assign 5 values to a vector with a length of 3 but I don&#39;t understand how to make it not do this and still have it work correctly.</div><div><br></div><div>Any ideas?</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Venk.</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
